## Context
The report (French) includes `tab_exp2_bib_quality.tex` in
§sec:exp2-sota:donnees (added by 0254). The artefact is English: caption
("Experiment 2: bibliography quality by agent and arm"), column headers
(Rows, S1 (%), S1 Prim., Notes, Bib) and arm labels (Naive/Optimised/Arm3/
Arm4) are all English. It is the only English table in the French Exp2
chapter. The 2×2 table already has a `_fr` variant precedent
(`tab_exp2_2x2_fr.tex` via `tabulate_exp2_2x2.py` locale labels).

## Actions
1. Parameterize `src/aedist/tabulate_exp2_bib_quality.py` labels (caption,
   headers, arm display names) by language, mirroring the `_TEX_LABELS`
   pattern in `tabulate_exp2_2x2.py`. Numbers stay locale-neutral.
2. Emit `tab_exp2_bib_quality_fr.tex` (new Makefile target in
   `experiments/render.mk`, committed handoff artifact).
3. Switch the report `\InputIfFileExists` to the French file.

## Test
`tab_exp2_bib_quality_fr.tex` caption/headers are French; the report PDF
greps clean of "Experiment 2: bibliography quality" in the donnees section.

## Exit criteria
- [ ] French variant generated and committed.
- [ ] Report includes the French variant; no English bib table survives.
- [ ] `make report` clean-room build passes.
